  "question": {
    "text": "How many of these molecules are diamagnetic and have bond order more than 2 <br/><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5.00",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> have bond order 3 and are diamagnetic also. <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> have bond order 2.5 but are paramagnetic. <br/><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> have bond order 2 and 1 respectively."
